lass=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">intros</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>i don't how to use <code>dsimp</code> to unfold • into <code>conjugate</code>. both <code>simp</code> and <code>dsimp</code> don't make any progress on the goal.</p>\n<p>moreover, this whole situation doesn't make sense to me becasue using the tactic <code>show 1 • b = b</code> fails with <code>failed to synthesis HSMul</code> . The only explanation i currently have is that this instance has some kind of clash with mathlib.</p>",
